                                        "entry_id": "330bd6b6-b41d-38ed-aea5-9a607054986d",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An adhesive bandage, a small piece of fabric or plastic that may be stuck to the skin in order to temporarily cover a small wound."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
