                                                "example_id": "9eab6362-5c88-4578-a5f7-7a2e7f3bdbdc",
                                                "sense_id": "2f488d16-2913-342b-bde5-02e2757c04b2",
                                                "text": "According to Forbes, Billie [Eilish] earned $53 million in 2020. Half of that was thanks to the Apple doc, and the other half was thanks to music sales. Cool-cool-cool, same!"
